; difficult-conversation-arrival-run.fk — the runnable door for the difficult-conversation
; counsel: print the arrival card, the whole counsel this body holds for someone who brings
; a conversation they dread, or one that just went wrong.
;
; Run it at session start, or the moment such a question arrives:
;
;   ./fkwu observe/difficult-conversation-arrival-run.fk
;
; The card is DATA in cognition/difficult-conversation-counsel.fk — each move names the cell
; it lives in — and its byte length is held by that cell's band so it always fits the
; session-start preview window it is written for. A session-start carrier in the origin repo
; runs this door when the kernel stands beside it and mirrors the card until it does; the
; recipe here is the source, the mirror composts.
;
; PRINT IT, do not merely RETURN it — a door whose whole job is to report should say its
; report on every kernel (preflight-run.fk records why). The value is returned too.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk cognition/dialogue-covenant.fk cognition/difficult-conversation-counsel.fk

(do
    (print_str (dcc-card))
    0)
